00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:36.400
Hey, check it out.
I got some moves of my own.

00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:41.234
365 degrees, 24/7.

00:08:41.234 --> 00:08:44.200
-Ew! That's my stepdad, Gary.

00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:45.501
