00:08:45.501 --> 00:08:47.767
-Hey, come on. You girls
are making some TikTaks?

00:08:47.767 --> 00:08:49.501
Have you seen that new A.I.?

00:08:49.501 --> 00:08:53.634
♪ Hash brown like ChatBLT ♪

00:08:53.634 --> 00:08:54.968
-Ew!

00:08:54.968 --> 00:08:58.267
-Anyway, if you like
cinnamon buns, hun, your mother

00:08:58.267 --> 00:09:01.167
and I are upstairs making
some gluten-free pastries.

00:09:01.167 --> 00:09:04.834
And this just in --
I have a sensitivity.

00:09:04.834 --> 00:09:07.968
♪ If you want a sweet treat
that's safe to eat ♪

00:09:07.968 --> 00:09:10.834
♪ You gotta make sure
