00:09:22.868 --> 00:09:25.968
♪ You spell "munch" backwards,
it still spells "munch" ♪

00:09:25.968 --> 00:09:28.200
-Ew! Gary, get out of here!

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:30.367
Come on!
-I had one more.

00:09:30.367 --> 00:09:34.067
Catch it on the flippity-flop!
-Come on!

00:09:34.067 --> 00:09:36.534
