00:09:36.534 --> 00:09:40.300
Okay, it's time for the "Ew!"
Speed Round, okay? Ready?

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:41.734
-Oh. Okay.

00:09:41.734 --> 00:09:43.367
-Here we go.

00:09:43.367 --> 00:09:44.601
"Minecraft."

00:09:44.601 --> 00:09:46.200
-Ew!

00:09:48.434 --> 00:09:49.434
-Jibbitz.

00:09:49.434 --> 00:09:51.567
-Ew!

00:09:52.634 --> 00:09:54.167
-Capybaras.

00:09:54.167 --> 00:09:56.701
-[ Laughs ] Ew!

00:09:57.534 --> 00:09:59.601
-Fjallraven backpacks.

00:09:59.601 --> 00:10:01.367
-Uh...ew!

00:10:01.367 --> 00:10:04.167
