00:10:25.234 --> 00:10:30.067
-"To Wong Foo

00:10:30.067 --> 00:10:33.100
Thanks for Everything!

00:10:33.100 --> 00:10:35.767
Julie Newmar"?

00:10:35.767 --> 00:10:36.901
