00:11:19.667 --> 00:11:22.434
What is life?! What is life?!

00:11:22.434 --> 00:11:23.801
This is crazy!

00:11:23.801 --> 00:11:26.300
-Yeah. It's crazy!

00:11:26.300 --> 00:11:28.000
-That's all the time
we have for "Ew!"

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:30.934
I want to thank Bjergen
for joining us tonight.

00:11:30.934 --> 00:11:33.501
Tune in next week. Ew!

00:11:33.501 --> 00:11:35.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:11:35.267 --> 00:11:40.567
